\viewkind4\uc1\pard\tx3780\tx3960\cf1\ul\b\f0\fs24\'b6 Verse 1\cf0\ulnone\b0 
\par 1. Saviour, we know Thou art
\par In every age the same:
\par Now, Lord, in our exert
\par The virtue of Thy name
\par And daily, through Thy word, increase
\par Thy blood-besprinkled witnesses.
\par 
\par \cf1\ul\b\'b6 Verse 2\cf0\ulnone\b0 
\par 2. Thy people, save below,
\par From every sinful stain,
\par Shall multiply and grow,
\par If Thy command ordain,
\par And one into a thousand rise,
\par And spread Thy praise through earth and skies.
\par 
\par \cf1\ul\b\'b6 Verse 3\cf0\ulnone\b0 
\par 3. In many a soul, and mine,
\par Thou hast displayed Thy power ;
\par But to Thy people join
\par Ten thousand thousand more,
\par Saved from the guilt and strength of sin,
\par In life and heart entirely clean.\tab 
\par                                  Amen.
\par \pard\f1 
\par \cf1\ul\b\f2 
\par }

